{"title": "Fierce Perilous Stakes (Condition)", "pageid": 27626, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fierce_Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)", "categories": ["Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Stakes_(Condition)\" title=\"Perilous Stakes (Condition)\">Perilous Stakes (Condition)</a>        </div>  \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perilous Stakes Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Perilous_Stakes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Perilous Stakes</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">15</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage and heal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. The entity scores a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> when rolling a 15 or higher. The entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to all damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MF_PERILOUS_STAKES</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MF_PERILOUS_STAKES+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MF_PERILOUS_STAKES+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This can be cast multiple times on the same target to apply multiple instances of the condition at once. The critical hit threshold reduction, bonus damage, and healing effect from each application all stack with each other. The damage vulnerability does not stack this way.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Perilous_Stakes\">Sources of Perilous Stakes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fierce_Perilous_Stakes\" title=\"Fierce Perilous Stakes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp/45px-Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp/60px-Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fierce Perilous Stakes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp/30px-Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Perilous_Stakes_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fierce_Perilous_Stakes\" title=\"Fierce Perilous Stakes\">Fierce Perilous Stakes</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202208\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20296/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8680/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1039570/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.412      1 -total\n 98.28%   47.578      1 Template:Condition_page\n 67.38%   32.619      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.23%   13.184      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 24.61%   11.915      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.00%    7.263      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.85%    7.190     25 Template:Trim\n 14.10%    6.825      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.93%    6.742      3 Template:Template_style\n 11.63%    5.630      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27626-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202208 and revision id 395233. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}